      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "本例中：结果反馈可以触发重新规划；\n反思提供指导，重新规划落实步骤调整。",
      "originalText": "本例中：结果反馈可以触发重新规划；\n反思提供指导，重新规划落实步骤调整。",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "e47",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1030,
      "width": 936,
      "height": 29.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 1281,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 999,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "重新规划也可用于适应新目标；反思可以判定无需修改。各机制按证据组合，没有固定的必经顺序。",
      "originalText": "重新规划也可用于适应新目标；反思可以判定无需修改。各机制按证据组合，没有固定的必经顺序。",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "e48",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1076,
      "width": 772,
      "height": 28.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 1282,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 999,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "执行和等待共用预算；重做前核查幂等与副作用，修改后重新验证，无法继续时停止。",
      "originalText": "执行和等待共用预算；重做前核查幂等与副作用，修改后重新验证，无法继续时停止。",
